# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Contact form backend (optional)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Create a free form at https://formspree.io
# 2. Copy the form ID from your endpoint URL:
#       https://formspree.io/f/abcdwxyz   →   ID is "abcdwxyz"
# 3. Copy this file to `.env` and paste the ID below.
#
# When set, the contact form submits directly over AJAX and shows an
# inline "Message sent!" confirmation. Leave it unset (or delete .env)
# and the form gracefully falls back to opening the visitor's mail app.
#
# NOTE: Vite only exposes vars prefixed with VITE_ to the browser.
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=
